            "review_title": "Review at The Waffle House",
            "review_text": "Christopher P\nHai Phong, Vietnam326 contributions\n1\nWorth the experience!! I would definitely come back again! Thank you very much\nMar 2024 • Solo\nI visited this place for the very first time and I was overwhelmed by how good it is. I’m just sorry I didn’t come here on the first morning when I stayed in Hanoi as I went to the old quarter for breakfast and no where offered to do an English breakfast. However, I compensated this by coming on the second morning and I had a gourmet waffle with maple syrup and a cappuccino. The staff were all lovely and friendly and I would like to award a special thank you for their hospitality! Thank you so very much and I will make a repeat visit when I return to Hanoi!\nRead more\nWritten March 12, 2024",
